WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.738
Caption Clash is a quick, silly party game. Three to ten players, and no skills required.

2
00:00:07.438 --> 00:00:17.655
Every round starts with a ridiculous picture. You write a caption for the top and one for the bottom. You can leave either one empty if the picture speaks for itself.

3
00:00:18.355 --> 00:00:24.606
Once the timer's up, all the captions are shown anonymously, and everyone votes for their favourite.

4
00:00:24.756 --> 00:00:27.458
You can't vote for your own, so don't even try.

5
00:00:28.158 --> 00:00:32.869
Each vote is worth a hundred points, and the winning caption gets a hundred more.

6
00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:36.987
Short and punchy beats long and clever almost every time.

7
00:00:37.687 --> 00:00:43.381
It gets really good when you play with people who know each other, because inside jokes win the room.
